{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"CLSA-2026-1794253355","published":"2026-11-09T19:42:49Z","modified":"2026-11-20T10:17:21.447194296Z","upstream":["CVE-2026-92388","CVE-2026-92391"],"summary":"Fix CVE(s): CVE-2026-92388, CVE-2026-92391","details":"   * SECURITY UPDATE: FTP wildcard write callback mixup\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-92388.patch: stop overwriting the\n       application's write callback and write data with the internal FTP\n       list parser during a wildcard transfer; route listing data to the\n       parser from Curl_client_chop_write() in lib/sendf.c instead, so a\n       failed wildcard LIST no longer leaves the handle pointing at the\n       parser (lib/ftp.c, lib/ftp.h, lib/ftplistparser.c,\n       lib/ftplistparser.h, lib/sendf.c).\n     - CVE-2026-92388\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: curl_mime_free stack overflow by recursion\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-92391.patch: free nested multipart mime\n       structures iteratively instead of recursively in curl_mime_free()\n       in lib/mime.c.\n     - CVE-2026-92391","affected":[{"package":{"name":"curl","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/curl?distro=ubuntu-18.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.58.0-2ubuntu3.24+tuxcare.els15"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu18.04els/CLSA-2026-1794253355.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libcurl3-gnutls","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libcurl3-gnutls?distro=ubuntu-18.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.58.0-2ubuntu3.24+tuxcare.els15"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/cloudlinux/tuxcare-osv/tree/main/data/els_os/ubuntu18.04els/CLSA-2026-1794253355.json"}},{"package":{"name":"libcurl3-nss","ecosystem":"TuxCare:Ubuntu:18.04","purl":"pkg:deb/tuxcare/libcurl3-nss?distro=ubuntu-18.04"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"7.58.0